  "solution": {
    "text": "Direction Ratios of the first line<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br />Hence, Direction Ratios of the first line are <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />For Direction Ratios of the second line<br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />Hence, Direction Ratios of the <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></math> line <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></math><br />Since, both the lines are perpendicular,<br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
